   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why distil?\nAn LLM per item is slow and costly.\nThe LLM labels 3.6k items once;\nthe student labels the remaining 205k.\n\nMeasured trade-off: zero-shot LLM\nwins on intent/urgency, the student\nwins on cost and throughput.",
   "originalText": "Why distil?\nAn LLM per item is slow and costly.\nThe LLM labels 3.6k items once;\nthe student labels the remaining 205k.\n\nMeasured trade-off: zero-shot LLM\nwins on intent/urgency, the student\nwins on cost and throughput.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "03-low-03-low-note-74-75",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
